[TEST] S4-U02 PASS  worst-case frame fits in 512 bytes
[TEST] S4-U03 PASS  overflow is detected
[TEST] S4-U04 PASS  E_STOP / RESUME parsed, junk ignored
[TEST] S4-U05a PASS  stays in WIFI_CONNECTING without WiFi
[TEST] S4-U05b PASS  WiFi up -> MQTT_CONNECTING
[TEST] S4-U05c PASS  broker connected -> ONLINE
[TEST] S4-U05d PASS  ONLINE publishes a new frame
[TEST] S4-U05e PASS  no telemetry -> HEARTBEAT
[TEST] S4-U05f PASS  HEARTBEAT publishes a heartbeat (FR-18)
[TEST] S4-U05g PASS  telemetry again -> ONLINE
[TEST] S4-U05h PASS  link lost -> RECONNECTING
[TEST] S4-U05i PASS  after the pause -> WIFI_CONNECTING
