[TEST] S3-U01 PASS  calibrates, then a flat road is quiet
[TEST] S3-U02a PASS  Z above threshold -> HUMP_TRACKING
[TEST] S3-U02b PASS  Z back at baseline -> hump height
[TEST] S3-U03 PASS  tallest hump is kept
[TEST] S3-U04 PASS  short spike above 3 g -> SHOCK
[TEST] S3-U05 PASS  a long reading is not a SHOCK
[TEST] S3-U06a PASS  SENSOR_FAULT ignores samples
[TEST] S3-U06b PASS  recovery -> CALIBRATING
