[TEST] S5-U01c PASS  button while running -> IDLE, STOP sent
[TEST] S5-U02a PASS  LINE_FOLLOW forwards steering to Motor
[TEST] S5-U02b PASS  barcode seen -> BARCODE_SCAN
[TEST] S5-U03 PASS  A=left 90, B=right 90, C=straight, D=u-turn
[TEST] S5-U03b PASS  decoded B -> BARCODE_CMD, turn right 90 sent
[TEST] S5-U03c PASS  turn finished -> back to LINE_FOLLOW
[TEST] S5-U04 PASS  decode failure -> LINE_FOLLOW, no turn
[TEST] S5-U05a PASS  hump start -> HUMP_TRAVERSE, slow
[TEST] S5-U05b PASS  hump done -> LINE_FOLLOW, tallest recorded
[TEST] S5-U05c PASS  IMU fault is noted but the car keeps driving (FR-19)
[TEST] S5-U06a PASS  obstacle -> OBSTACLE_SCAN, STOP sent
[TEST] S5-U06b PASS  no profile while the car is still moving
[TEST] S5-U06c PASS  car stopped -> profile ordered
[TEST] S5-U06d PASS  result -> OBSTACLE_BYPASS
[TEST] S5-U06e PASS  bypass done -> LINE_REACQUIRE
[TEST] S5-U06f PASS  line still lost -> keep creeping
[TEST] S5-U06g PASS  line found -> LINE_FOLLOW
[TEST] S5-U07a PASS  line lost too long -> FAULT_RECOVERY
[TEST] S5-U07b PASS  FAULT_RECOVERY -> IDLE, no restart without BTN_START
[TEST] S5-U08a PASS  E_STOP halts the car
[TEST] S5-U08b PASS  the button cannot clear E_STOP
[TEST] S5-U08c PASS  RESUME -> LINE_FOLLOW
[TEST] S5-U09 PASS  ENCODER_FAULT -> FAULT_RECOVERY
[TEST] S5-U10a PASS  narrow obstacle is profiled
[TEST] S5-U10b PASS  the side with more clearance is chosen
[TEST] S5-U10c PASS  obstacle wider than the sweep -> fault
[TEST] S5-U10d PASS  no centre echo -> fault
[TEST] S5-U11 PASS  Mission starts in IDLE after INIT
